+**Deploy on Wasmer Edge:**
+
+- `npm run build` outputs the static site to the `build` folder. To host it on Wasmer Edge instead, import your own copy of this repository so the deployed site includes your customizations.
+
+[![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-171717?logo=wasmer&logoColor=white)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=ashutosh1919%2FmasterPortfolio)
